<title>UK: Polypipe H1 pretax profit up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Polypipe H1 pretax profit up 16 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, March 10 - Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.65		   vs 4.06</p>
<p> Dividend		   0.92		   vs 0.83</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    11.28		  vs 9.76</p>
<p> Turnover		   93.12		  vs 94.19</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British building products manufacturer is Polypipe Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
